{"title":"List of server commands/gamemode","sourceTitle":"List of server commands/gamemode/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/gamemode\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"List of server commands/gamemode (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/gamemode/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Liste des commandes serveur/gamemode (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/gamemode/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Список серверных команд/gamemode (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><code>/gamemode [0..4|guest|survival|creative|spectator]</code><br />Os nomes dos modos podem ser encurtados para qualquer comprimento. Define seu modo de jogo:\n<ul><li><code>0|guest</code> Modo visitante - Não é possível colocar/remover nenhum bloco, mas pode interagir com eles</li>\n<li><code>1|survival</code> Modo de sobrevivência - Pode quebrar/colocar blocos lentamente. Pode morrer. Não posso voar. Inventário de sobrevivência.</li>\n<li><code>2|creative</code> Modo criativo - Acesso a todos os blocos através do inventário criativo. Quebra instantânea de bloco. Não posso morrer. Pode voar.</li>\n<li><code>3|spectator</code> Modo espectador - Não pode colocar/remover blocos e não pode interagir com nada, mas pode voar.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><code>/gamemode [playername] [0..4]</code><br />Define o modo de jogo para determinado jogador.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of server commands\">Lista de comandos do servidor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"List of server commands\"> </a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 291/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 150/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 957/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.837      1 Template:Ll\n100.00%    0.837      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:170146-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120301 and revision id 377208. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":377208,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=List_of_server_commands%2Fgamemode%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T12:03:02.358Z"}